{"code":0,"data":{"title":"统一支付回调通知","content":"<h1 id=\"s-j2o050v8\">一、接口说明</h1><ul><li><p>支付订单到终态后vivo支付平台通过接口回调给开发者，回调接口地址为下单时传入，开发者可通过回调或者回查进行订单终态的闭环，回调接口内容实现如下。</p></li><li><p>vivo支付平台回调方式默认为<code>POST</code>，开发者如需更改回调请求方式为<code>GET</code>，可根据自身规范要求联系vivo支付平台说明情况并要求更改。</p></li></ul><h1 id=\"s-npgnmvyq\"><br>二、接口请求</h1><h2 id=\"s-o45mifk8\">2.1 请求参数</h2><p><strong>Headers：</strong></p><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"160\" style=\"width: 160px\"><p><strong>参数名称</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"399\" style=\"width: 399px\"><p><strong>参数值</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"199\" style=\"width: 199px\"><p><strong>备注</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"160\" style=\"width: 160px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Content-Type</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"399\" style=\"width: 399px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>application/x-www-form-urlencoded</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"199\" style=\"width: 199px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>Body:</strong></p><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"159\" style=\"width: 159px\"><p><strong>参数名称</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"99\" style=\"width: 99px\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"92\" style=\"width: 92px\"><p><strong>是否必须</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>示例</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>备注</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"159\" style=\"width: 159px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>respContent</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"99\" style=\"width: 99px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"92\" style=\"width: 92px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>见下文3.1回调请求示例展示</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>返回内容 JSON 字符串, 具体字段详见下文respContent 结构化参数展示</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"159\" style=\"width: 159px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>sign</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"99\" style=\"width: 99px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"92\" style=\"width: 92px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>QWFGQFWQ55GWEG</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>签名，签名需验签，验签操作见<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/815#s-z1vxu1cv\">服务端接入指南-请求加签与验签</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"159\" style=\"width: 159px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>signType</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"99\" style=\"width: 99px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"92\" style=\"width: 92px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>RSA</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>签名类型，固定为RSA</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>respContent 结构化参数</strong></p><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"200\" style=\"width: 200px\"><p><strong>字段</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"92\" style=\"width: 92px\"><p><strong>类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"401\" style=\"width: 401px\"><p><strong>说明</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"366\" style=\"width: 366px\"><p><strong>备注</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"200\" style=\"width: 200px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>appId</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"92\" style=\"width: 92px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"401\" style=\"width: 401px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>应用编号</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"366\" style=\"width: 366px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"200\" style=\"width: 200px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>merchantOrderNo</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"92\" style=\"width: 92px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"401\" style=\"width: 401px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>商户订单号</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"366\" style=\"width: 366px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"200\" style=\"width: 200px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>tradeOrderNo</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"92\" style=\"width: 92px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"401\" style=\"width: 401px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>vivo交易订单</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"366\" style=\"width: 366px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"200\" style=\"width: 200px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>tradeStatus</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"92\" style=\"width: 92px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"401\" style=\"width: 401px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>订单状态 订单状态 success 成功 closed 关闭</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"366\" style=\"width: 366px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"200\" style=\"width: 200px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>tradeType</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"92\" style=\"width: 92px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"401\" style=\"width: 401px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>交易类型</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"366\" style=\"width: 366px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"200\" style=\"width: 200px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>vivoOpenid</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"92\" style=\"width: 92px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"401\" style=\"width: 401px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>vivo账号openid</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"366\" style=\"width: 366px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"200\" style=\"width: 200px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>currencyType</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"92\" style=\"width: 92px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"401\" style=\"width: 401px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>货币类型，人民币：CNY</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"366\" style=\"width: 366px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"200\" style=\"width: 200px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>paySuccessTime</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"92\" style=\"width: 92px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"401\" style=\"width: 401px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付成功时间</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"366\" style=\"width: 366px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>格式 yyyyMMddHHmmss</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"200\" style=\"width: 200px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>extInfo</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"92\" style=\"width: 92px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"401\" style=\"width: 401px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>附加参数，回调通知和查询接口会原样返回</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"366\" style=\"width: 366px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"200\" style=\"width: 200px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>paymentWayInfo</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"92\" style=\"width: 92px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"401\" style=\"width: 401px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付方式详情，数组格式字符串[{\"\":\"\",\"\":\"\"},{\"\":\"\",\"\":\"\"}]</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"366\" style=\"width: 366px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>List&lt;Object&gt; 的JSON String, PaymentWayInfo 中对象见 paymentWayInfo 对象格式</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"200\" style=\"width: 200px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>tradeAmount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"92\" style=\"width: 92px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"401\" style=\"width: 401px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>交易总金额，单位分（国家最小货币单位）</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"366\" style=\"width: 366px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"200\" style=\"width: 200px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>orderType</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"92\" style=\"width: 92px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"401\" style=\"width: 401px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>订单类型</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"366\" style=\"width: 366px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>1 支付 2 代扣</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"200\" style=\"width: 200px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>failMsg</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"92\" style=\"width: 92px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"401\" style=\"width: 401px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>失败原因</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"366\" style=\"width: 366px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>代扣失败时添加</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"200\" style=\"width: 200px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>failCode</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"92\" style=\"width: 92px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"401\" style=\"width: 401px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>失败码</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"366\" style=\"width: 366px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>代扣失败时添加</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>PaymentWayInfo 对象格式</strong></p><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"202\" style=\"width: 202px\"><p><strong>字段</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"99\" style=\"width: 99px\"><p><strong>类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"360\" style=\"width: 360px\"><p><strong>说明</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"376\" style=\"width: 376px\"><p><strong>备注</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"202\" style=\"width: 202px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>paymentWayCode</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"99\" style=\"width: 99px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"360\" style=\"width: 360px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付方式</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"376\" style=\"width: 376px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付方式详见下文支付方式映射编码</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"202\" style=\"width: 202px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>payAmount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"99\" style=\"width: 99px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"360\" style=\"width: 360px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付金额，单位分</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"376\" style=\"width: 376px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"202\" style=\"width: 202px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>thirdChnOrderNo</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"99\" style=\"width: 99px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"360\" style=\"width: 360px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>第三方支付渠道订单号</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"376\" style=\"width: 376px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"202\" style=\"width: 202px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>realPayWay</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"99\" style=\"width: 99px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"360\" style=\"width: 360px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>真实支付方式</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"376\" style=\"width: 376px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>paymentWayCode 支付方式映射编码</strong></p><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"261\" style=\"width: 261px\"><p><strong>代号</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"279\" style=\"width: 279px\"><p><strong>名称</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"261\" style=\"width: 261px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>ALIPAY_APP</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"279\" style=\"width: 279px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付宝</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"261\" style=\"width: 261px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>WECHAT_APP</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"279\" style=\"width: 279px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>微信支付</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"261\" style=\"width: 261px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>WECHAT_INDIRECT_APP</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"279\" style=\"width: 279px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>微信间联支付</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id=\"s-d8vk4y5m\">2.2 请求响应</h2><ul><li><p>开发者业务处理成功之后响应vivo支付平台 <code>success</code> 或者 <code>SUCCESS</code> ，两种success标识均代表成功，其他响应vivo支付平台均认定为回调失败</p></li><li><p>回调失败后vivo支付平台会进行梯度间隔时间重试，累计回调请求15次，重试间隔如下：<code>2s:3s:5s:10s:1m:5m:20m:1h:2h:3h:3h:3h:6h:6h</code></p></li></ul><h1 id=\"s-yyqcc1wr\"><br>三、其他说明</h1><h2 id=\"s-2le1jrwm\">3.1 回调请求示例</h2><pre><code>{\n    \"sign\": \"\",\n    \"signType\": \"RSA\",\n    \"respContent\": \"{\\\"appId\\\":\\\"105134530\\\",\\\"currencyType\\\":\\\"CNY\\\",\\\"merchantOrderNo\\\":\\\"175661541311612416\\\",\\\"orderType\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"paySuccessTime\\\":\\\"20240911173627\\\",\\\"paymentWayInfo\\\":[{\\\"payAmount\\\":\\\"900\\\",\\\"paymentWayCode\\\":\\\"WECHAT_APP\\\",\\\"thirdChnOrderNo\\\":\\\"42000024136202410113397392373\\\"}],\\\"tradeAmount\\\":\\\"900\\\",\\\"tradeOrderNo\\\":\\\"202410255445416256881664\\\",\\\"tradeStatus\\\":\\\"success\\\",\\\"tradeType\\\":\\\"QUICK_APP_SERVICE_PROVIDER\\\",\\\"vivoOpenid\\\":\\\"672711131562d3ca\\\"}\"\n}</code></pre><h2 id=\"s-4zzws0f0\">3.2 获取待验签字符串</h2><p>详细验签流程见<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/815#s-z1vxu1cv\">服务端接入指南-请求加签与验签</a></p><p>vivo支付获取加签/验签内容全局统一，具体方法为整体参数在剔除<code>sign</code>、<code>signType</code>两个字段后，将剩余字段按照字典序排序并用<code>&amp;</code>符号将各个参数按<code>key=value</code>格式拼接得到待加签/验签字符串内容。由于回调接口参数中仅有<code>sign</code>、<code>signType</code>、<code>respContent</code>三个字段，剔除字段后最终参与验签的仅有 <code>respContent</code>字段，所以最终待验签的字符串直接为<code>respContent=xxxxxxx</code>，上述回调请求示例中待验签字符串内容如下：</p><pre><code>respContent={\\\"appId\\\":\\\"105134530\\\",\\\"currencyType\\\":\\\"CNY\\\",\\\"merchantOrderNo\\\":\\\"175661541311612416\\\",\\\"orderType\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"paySuccessTime\\\":\\\"20240911173627\\\",\\\"paymentWayInfo\\\":[{\\\"payAmount\\\":\\\"900\\\",\\\"paymentWayCode\\\":\\\"WECHAT_APP\\\",\\\"thirdChnOrderNo\\\":\\\"42000024136202410113397392373\\\"}],\\\"tradeAmount\\\":\\\"900\\\",\\\"tradeOrderNo\\\":\\\"202410255445416256881664\\\",\\\"tradeStatus\\\":\\\"success\\\",\\\"tradeType\\\":\\\"QUICK_APP_SERVICE_PROVIDER\\\",\\\"vivoOpenid\\\":\\\"672711131562d3ca\\\"}\n</code></pre><p><br></p>","versionCode":6,"updateTime":1729760677000,"breadCrumbs":"快应用管理,快应用支付平台接入,收银台模式,统一支付回调通知","docType":3,"docMessageType":"app_distribution"}}